      "text": "Spends moon crystals to use skills. When all moon crystals have been spent, her Skill 1 and Skill 2 will enter their cooldowns, and her next Basic Attack is enhanced, dealing extra damage. Skill 1 and Skill 2 apply a Mark on hit. Hitting marked targets again triggers additional effects."
